Description: iPhone and iCloud companion for elementary OS
 Covalence links an iPhone to the desktop over Bluetooth: notifications,
 media controls, messages (MAP), contacts and call history (PBAP), calls
 through PipeWire's hands-free gateway, battery, and AirPods controls.
 .
 It also connects iCloud mail, calendars, reminders and contacts through
 Evolution Data Server, and mounts iCloud Drive and iCloud Photos with
 rclone (1.69 or later).
 .
 Covalence is independent free software, not affiliated with Apple Inc.
